{"id":"wb-5-330","name":"崇妙保圣坚牢塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"崇妙保圣坚牢塔","text":"崇妙保圣坚牢塔（平话字：Cùng-miêu-bō̤-séng-giĕng-lò̤-ták（福州话读音）），位于中华人民共和国福建省福州市鼓楼区八一七中路旁，乌山东麓。因塔身为用花岗石砌建，风化后略呈黑色，故俗称“乌塔”（平话字：Ŭ-ták）。由五代时期闽国皇帝王延羲修建，是中国为数不多的五代石塔之一。宝塔及其内部的佛像、文字是研究闽国历史、宗教及雕刻艺术的珍贵资料。1961年公布为福建省文物保护单位。2001年成为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B4%87%E5%A6%99%E4%BF%9D%E5%9C%A3%E5%9D%9A%E7%89%A2%E5%A1%94","revisionId":91693480,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91693480","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ef115f2bb648fe05e9023089.jpg","title":"崇妙保圣坚牢塔_东侧远.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B4%87%E5%A6%99%E4%BF%9D%E5%9C%A3%E5%9D%9A%E7%89%A2%E5%A1%94_%E4%B8%9C%E4%BE%A7%E8%BF%9C.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/%E5%B4%87%E5%A6%99%E4%BF%9D%E5%9C%A3%E5%9D%9A%E7%89%A2%E5%A1%94_%E4%B8%9C%E4%BE%A7%E8%BF%9C.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"董辰兴","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​福州乌山历史风貌区","width":320,"height":239}}